<title>JAPAN: Heiwa Real Estate -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Heiwa Real Estate -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.87		vs	    7.11</p>
<p> Operating	    2.70		vs	    2.74</p>
<p> Current		2.17		vs	    2.40</p>
<p> Net		    1.25		vs	    1.40</p>
<p> EPS		   11.07 yen	  vs	   12.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    113 million	  vs	 113 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Heiwa Real Estate Co Ltd is the owner of the Stock Exchange buildings in Tokyo, Osaka, Nagoya and Fukuoka and also deals in housing property.</p>
</text>
